% composition-series: Ontario Listening Bridges — set 1
% composition-grade: 7
% composition-elements: major and minor triads in F minor (Fm, Bbm and Cm minor, Db major); a written bass-register part (G2-F3) with an off-beat syncopation on the "and" of beat 2 against the melody's dotted quarters that start on beat 2; layered texture of melody, bass and band; arrangement through density, written into the notes: the bass drops out in bars 5-6 and returns in bar 7
% composition-listen: Kabza De Small — "Sponono" (featuring Wizkid, Burna Boy, Cassper Nyovest and Madumane), from the album I Am the King of Amapiano: Sweet & Dust, Piano Hub, 2020
% composition-listen-url: https://music.apple.com/us/song/sponono-feat-wizkid-burna-boy-cassper-nyovest-madumane/1680728759
% composition-bridge: Listen for spacious tempo, keyboard harmony, vocal layers and the pitch-shaped log-drum bass as an arranging voice.
% composition-context: Amapiano developed in South African townships and is shaped by producers, dancers, DJs and changing local scenes. This new classroom minor loop is not an amapiano track.
% composition-distance: Original melody, bass line and chord loop; no log-drum line, sample, vocal, chord sequence or production from the reference is copied, and no log-drum sound is imitated.
